A destroy of a mutex that leaves it on its holder's ring.
The holder holds an object that is no longer live.

Caught-by: fuzz fuzz-pmp8 fuzz-rp2350 fuzz-smp2 fuzz-work qemu-replay
Report: a thread holds something that is not a mutex

